# Abyssal Sanctum .gitignore
#
# Sanctum's work involves disk images, evidence and malware. Anything of
# that kind must never be committed, even by accident, so it is ignored
# here wherever it might land, not only under out/.

# Build output ------------------------------------------------------------------

# ISO builds, logs, manifests, package and Rust caches, VM sockets.
/out/
# Cargo build output.
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Written by the release workflow (scripts/release/release-notes.sh).
/release-notes.md

# ISOs, disk and virtual machine images -----------------------------------------

*.iso
*.img
*.raw
*.qcow2
*.vmdk
*.vdi
*.vhd
*.vhdx
# The disk-safety test fixtures are compressed images and stay tracked.
!/tests/fixtures/disk-safety/*.img.xz

# Evidence, case files and system artifacts --------------------------------------

# Forensic images (E01/Ex01, AFF, raw dd) and ddrescue maps.
*.[Ee]0[1-9]
*.[Ee]x0[1-9]
*.aff
*.aff4
*.dd
*.map
# Memory images and Windows memory files.
*.mem
*.vmem
*.dmp
*.lime
hiberfil.sys
pagefile.sys
swapfile.sys
# Windows event logs and registry hives copied out of a system.
*.evtx
NTUSER.DAT
UsrClass.dat
# Packet captures can contain credentials and private traffic.
*.pcap
*.pcapng
# Case directories and session logs (docs/security/forensic-workflow.md).
/case/
/cases/
/case-*/
session-*.log

# Malware, quarantine and detection content --------------------------------------

# Never commit live samples or quarantined files. Test corpora live outside
# the repository (antimalware gap analysis, section 8).
/samples/
/corpus/
/malware/
/quarantine/
**/quarantine/
*.vir
*.infected
*.quarantine
# ClamAV signature databases (downloaded or from update packs).
*.cvd
*.cld
*.cud
# Compiled YARA rules.
*.yarc
# Collected package sources for a release (scripts/release/fetch-sources.sh).
/sources-v*/
*.src.tar.gz

# Secrets and keys ----------------------------------------------------------------

.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.kdbx
.netrc
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
*.minisign.key
minisign.key
# Public keys (*.pub) may be committed deliberately; private keys never.

# Editors, tools and operating systems --------------------------------------------

.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Personal Claude Code settings; shared project settings may be committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
